<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Tennis-Tasmanian Women's International result.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Tennis-Tasmanian Women's International result.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART 1996-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result from the Tasmanian Women's International tennis tournament on Saturday:</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>Dominique van Roost (Belgium) beat Marianne Werdel Witmeyer (U.S.) 6-3 6-3.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
